# bulk GaAs

units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 delay 0 check no

read_data	./lastFrame

pair_style	deepmd ./GaAs-semi.pb
pair_coeff  * *	As Ga


mass            1 74.92
mass            2 69.72

group           As  type 1
group           Ga  type 2

velocity        all create 2000 23456789
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nvt temp 2000 2000 0.1

thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal temp press vol 
thermo          1000
dump        1 all custom 1000 GaAs-2000k.xyz id type x y z

run            2000000
